{"id":"level-up-2026-09-28","name":"2026-09-28 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s501","en":"The new footbridge allows walkers to cross the busy highway.","zh":"新的人行天桥让行人可以穿过繁忙的公路。","note":"highway · 公路 · a busy highway","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s502","en":"There are three libraries within a radius of two kilometres.","zh":"两公里半径范围内有三家图书馆。","note":"radius · 半径； 周围， 范围 · within a radius","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s503","en":"The craftsperson shaped the molten glass into a delicate bowl.","zh":"工匠把熔融玻璃塑成了一只精致的碗。","note":"molten · 熔化的 · molten glass","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s504","en":"The whistle was the signal for the race to begin.","zh":"哨声是比赛开始的信号。","note":"signal · 发信号； 标志着；信号；暗号；标志 · a clear signal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s505","en":"A noisy workspace can impair concentration during complicated tasks.","zh":"嘈杂的工作环境可能妨碍处理复杂任务时的专注。","note":"impair · 损害； 削弱 · impair concentration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s506","en":"The courier left the parcel with our neighbour this morning.","zh":"快递员今早把包裹交给了我们的邻居。","note":"parcel · 包裹 · deliver a parcel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s507","en":"The number of visitors remained static throughout the winter.","zh":"整个冬季，访客人数一直没有变化。","note":"static · 静电；[-s] · remain static","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s508","en":"The lecture introduced research methods used to study autoimmune diseases.","zh":"讲座介绍了用于研究自身免疫疾病的方法。","note":"autoimmune · 自身免疫的 · autoimmune disease","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s509","en":"The long journey began to exhaust our limited water supplies.","zh":"漫长的旅程开始耗尽我们有限的饮水储备。","note":"exhaust · 使非常疲倦， 使疲惫不堪； 用尽， 耗尽；废气， 蒸汽 · exhaust one's supplies","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s510","en":"The chemistry teacher demonstrated why this powder is soluble in water.","zh":"化学老师演示了这种粉末为什么可溶于水。","note":"soluble · 可溶的； 可解决的 · soluble in water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s511","en":"A period of retrenchment forced the theatre to reduce its programme.","zh":"一段紧缩时期迫使剧院缩减了演出安排。","note":"retrenchment · 节省； 削减 · financial retrenchment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s512","en":"She spoke with conviction about the importance of public libraries.","zh":"她满怀坚定信念地谈论公共图书馆的重要性。","note":"conviction · 定罪； 坚信， 确信 · a firm conviction","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s513","en":"The bag's shoulder strap broke while I was boarding the train.","zh":"我上火车时，包的肩带断了。","note":"strap · 带子；捆扎； 包扎 · a shoulder strap","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s514","en":"The child stirred her juice with a reusable straw.","zh":"孩子用可重复使用的吸管搅拌果汁。","note":"straw · 稻草； 吸管 · a drinking straw","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s515","en":"The town hopes to diversify its economy by attracting creative businesses.","zh":"这个镇希望吸引创意企业，使经济更加多元化。","note":"diversify · 多样化 · diversify the economy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s516","en":"His inventive solution turned unused shelves into a reading corner.","zh":"他的创意方案把闲置书架改成了阅读角。","note":"inventive · 发明的， 创造的； 善于发明创造的 · an inventive solution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s517","en":"The graph shows monthly changes in rainfall over one year.","zh":"这张图展示了一年内降雨量每月的变化。","note":"graph · 图， 图表， 曲线图 · a line graph","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s518","en":"Please contact the office regarding changes to your course selection.","zh":"关于选课的变动，请联系办公室。","note":"regarding · 关于 · regarding your application","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s519","en":"We stopped at a petrol station before entering the hills.","zh":"进山前，我们在一家加油站停了一下。","note":"petrol · 汽油 · a petrol station","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s520","en":"The museum agreed to repatriate the artefacts after lengthy discussions.","zh":"经过漫长讨论，博物馆同意将文物送回原属国。","note":"repatriate · 把遣返回国； 归国 · repatriate artefacts","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s521","en":"The reviewer found the restaurant's elaborate menu unnecessarily pretentious.","zh":"评论者觉得餐厅花哨的菜单显得过分做作。","note":"pretentious · 自命不凡的， 自负的； 炫耀的； 做作的 · a pretentious style","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s522","en":"The council plans to tackle litter with more public bins.","zh":"市政委员会计划增设公共垃圾桶，处理乱扔垃圾的问题。","note":"tackle · 对付，处理；向某人提起；抢截，抢球；用具， 器具； 滑轮， 滑车； 抢截 · tackle a problem","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s523","en":"The university launched a large-scale survey of student travel habits.","zh":"大学开展了一项关于学生出行习惯的大规模调查。","note":"large-scale · 大规模的， 大范围的 · a large-scale project","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s524","en":"The novel follows two friends who play truant one afternoon.","zh":"小说讲述了两个朋友某天下午逃学的经历。","note":"truant · 逃避责任；旷课；逃学者； 逃避者 · play truant","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s525","en":"Messages on my phone distract me from the book.","zh":"手机上的消息让我读书分心。","note":"distract · 转移； 使分心 · distract someone from","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s526","en":"The exhibition includes historical posters about seasonal influenza.","zh":"展览包含了关于季节性流感的历史海报。","note":"influenza · 流行性感冒 · seasonal influenza","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s527","en":"We kept the handmade candles for a special occasion.","zh":"我们把手工蜡烛留着用于特别的场合。","note":"occasion · 时刻，时候；场合；重大活动，盛会；时机，机会；起因，理由；引起， 惹起 · a special occasion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s528","en":"Squeeze half a lemon over the salad before serving.","zh":"上桌前，把半个柠檬的汁挤在沙拉上。","note":"squeeze · 压榨，榨取；捏，挤压；挤入，挤过；向…勒索；挤压， 捏； 紧缺， 拮据， 经济困难； 减少， 削减 · squeeze a lemon","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s529","en":"They used a small loan to buy equipment for the bakery.","zh":"他们用一笔小额贷款为面包店购买设备。","note":"loan · 贷款， 借 · a bank loan","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s530","en":"The proposal contains several ideas worthy of further discussion.","zh":"提案中有几个值得进一步讨论的想法。","note":"worthy · 有价值的； 值得的 · worthy of attention","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s531","en":"The old delivery van seems to guzzle fuel on short trips.","zh":"那辆旧送货车跑短途时似乎特别耗油。","note":"guzzle · 狂饮， 暴饮； 大量消耗 · guzzle fuel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s532","en":"The exhibition exceeded our expectations for visitor numbers.","zh":"展览的参观人数超过了我们的预期。","note":"expectation · 期待，预期； · exceed expectations","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s533","en":"Improved storage helped the shop reduce food spoilage during summer.","zh":"改善储存条件帮助商店减少了夏季食品变质。","note":"spoilage · 变质； 损坏 · food spoilage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s534","en":"The soap dispenser beside the sink needs refilling again.","zh":"洗手池旁的皂液器又需要补充皂液了。","note":"dispenser · 药剂师， 配药师； 分配者， 施予者； 自动售货机 · a soap dispenser","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s535","en":"The road will remain closed for the duration of repairs.","zh":"修路期间，道路将一直关闭。","note":"duration · 持续， 持续的时间， 期间 · for the duration of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s536","en":"The small boat carried a heavy load of fishing equipment.","zh":"小船装载了大量沉重的捕鱼设备。","note":"load · 装载；装；负荷； 装载 · a heavy load","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s537","en":"The novel follows an urban sophisticate visiting a remote village.","zh":"小说讲述了一位见多识广的都市人造访偏远村庄的经历。","note":"sophisticate · 久经世故的人； 精通者 · an urban sophisticate","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s538","en":"The ferry carries passengers across the river every half hour.","zh":"渡船每半小时运送乘客过河一次。","note":"ferry · 渡运；渡船；摆渡 · a passenger ferry","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s539","en":"The new students needed time to acclimatise to the colder weather.","zh":"新生需要时间适应更冷的天气。","note":"acclimatise · 服水土； 适应新环境 · acclimatise to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s540","en":"Do not ignore the warning signs beside the unstable cliff.","zh":"不要无视不稳固悬崖旁的警告标志。","note":"ignore · 不顾， 不理， 忽视 · ignore a warning","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s541","en":"The class compared seasonal patterns in each hemisphere.","zh":"全班比较了两个半球的季节规律。","note":"hemisphere · 半球； 大脑半球 · the southern hemisphere","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s542","en":"The debate examined different views on the future of nuclear energy.","zh":"辩论探讨了关于核能未来的不同观点。","note":"nuclear · 核能的， 原子能的 · nuclear energy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s543","en":"The audience began to applaud before the final note faded.","zh":"最后一个音符尚未消散，观众就开始鼓掌。","note":"applaud · 鼓掌， 喝彩； 称赞 · applaud a performance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s544","en":"We watched a recording of the lunar eclipse in class.","zh":"我们在课堂上观看了月食的录像。","note":"lunar · 月的； 月亮的 · a lunar eclipse","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s545","en":"I like to relax by sketching birds in the garden.","zh":"我喜欢在花园里画鸟，借此放松。","note":"relax · 放松 · relax after work","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s546","en":"Please relay the updated meeting time to the other volunteers.","zh":"请把更新后的会议时间转告其他志愿者。","note":"relay · 接力赛；中继设备['riːleI;ri'leI]；传送； 转播 · relay a message","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s547","en":"The writer described his tiny cottage as a humble abode.","zh":"作家把自己的小屋称为简陋的居所。","note":"abode · 房屋， 家， 住所 · a humble abode","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-28:s548","en":"You should ask permission before using someone else's photographs.","zh":"使用别人的照片前，你应该征求许可。","note":"permission · 允许， 准许 · ask permission",